  "published": "2026-09-18T11:09:21Z",
  "modified": "2026-09-18T11:09:21Z",
  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: plain text response injection via a premature\n     response from an SSL-proxied upstream\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-1642.patch: reject a response received in\n       ngx_http_upstream_process_header before the upstream SSL handshake\n       has started (u->ssl set, c->ssl still NULL) and retry the next\n       upstream, so a man-in-the-middle on the proxy-to-upstream path can\n       no longer have plain text data parsed as the upstream response\n     - CVE-2026-1642",
